        <content src="Text/part0837.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_774" playOrder="774">
        <navLabel>
        <text>品牌页</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0838.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_775" playOrder="775">
        <navLabel>
        <text>正文目录</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0841.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_776" playOrder="776">
        <navLabel>
        <text>我们为何为同一件事哭和笑</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0842.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_777" playOrder="777">
        <navLabel>
        <text>论良心</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0843.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_778" playOrder="778">
        <navLabel>
        <text>命运与理智经常相遇在一条道上</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0844.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_779" playOrder="779">
        <navLabel>
        <text>论对懦夫行为的惩罚</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0845.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_780" playOrder="780">
        <navLabel>
        <text>论言过其实</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0846.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_781" playOrder="781">
        <navLabel>
        <text>探讨哲学就是学习死亡</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0847.xhtml"/>
        </navPoint>
        <navPoint id="np_782" playOrder="782">
        <navLabel>
        <text>How We Weep and Laugh at the Same Thing</text>
        </navLabel>
        <content src="Text/part0848.xhtml"/>
          <navPoint id="np_783" playOrder="783">
          <navLabel>
          <text>How We Weep and Laugh at the Same Thing</text>
          </navLabel>
